    "Events that stop the work, such as permission and login, are announced during quiet hours too." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "İzin ve giriş gibi işi durduran olaylar sessiz saatlerde de bildirilir."
